{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xeno's Adventure is a run and gun action game with focus on boss fights and harder difficulty. You will explore different worlds, battle mind controlled monsters and bosses, all in a drawn 2D Pixel Art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Xeno as you traverse different worlds, upgrade your stats, learn powerful skills, while you try to save all worlds from the antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xeno's Adventure Demo includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 out of 3 Worlds to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 out of 12 Platformer Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 out of 13 Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Shops (Unlock Skills, Upgrade Skills &amp; Upgrade your Character's Stats)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909840?t=1754377927","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909840?t=1754377927","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909840/bd49328255fd0af54ba67fc5531842969f378fdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754377927","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909840/bd49328255fd0af54ba67fc5531842969f378fdf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754377927","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xeno's Adventure is a run and gun action game with focus on boss fights and harder difficulty. You will explore different worlds, battle mind controlled monsters and bosses, all in a drawn 2D Pixel Art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Xeno as you trav